\v 14 “\add ≈However,\add* if¦46412 his burnt¦46416 offering¦46416 to¦46418 Yahweh¦46418 will be a bird¦46415, then¦46419 \add ≈it must¦46419 be either a dove¦46427 or¦46423 a young¦46426 pigeon\add*.
