\p
\v 1 “\add ≈Now\add* if¦46734 it's a¦46736 sacrifice¦46736 for a peace¦46737 offering¦46737, if¦46739 it's from the¦46742 \bd herd¦46742\bd*, then¦46734 either a¦46747 male¦46747 or¦46748 female¦46750 can be presented¦46752 to¦46753 Yahweh¦46754 \add ≈as long as it has no¦46751 defects¦46751\add*.
\v 2 \add @The¦46756 presenter¦46756\add* must¦46756 lay their hand¦46757 on¦46758 the¦46760 head¦46760 of¦46760 the \add ≈bull or cow\add*, then¦46762 he¦46762 must¦46762 slaughter it \add ≈in front of¦46763\add* the¦46764 \add ≈sacred\add* tent¦46764. Then¦46766 the¦46767 \add #priest¦46769\add* Aharon's¦46768 sons¦46767 will¦46766 splash¦46766 the¦46772 blood¦46772 on¦46773 the¦46775 altar¦46775 \add ≈on each¦46776 side\add*.
