\v 6 “\add ≈However,\add* if¦46845 the¦46849 sacrifice¦46851 for a peace¦46852 offering¦46852 is from the \bd flock¦46849\bd*, then¦46845 either a¦46854 male¦46854 or¦46855 a¦46856 female¦46856 can be presented¦46858 to Yahweh¦46853 \add ≈as long as it¦46858 has no¦46857 defects¦46857\add*.
