\v 9 From¦46899 that peace¦46900 offering¦46901, he¦46898 must¦46898 present¦46898 the fat as a gift to¦46902 Yahweh¦46902, \add ≈along with\add* the¦46904 entire¦46917 fatty tail¦46904 (cut off near¦46906 the¦46907 backbone¦46907), the¦46911 fat¦46911 covering¦46912 the¦46915 innards¦46915 and¦46916 which¦46920 is¦46921 part of the¦46923 innards¦46923,
