\v 8 The¦52905 \add >person who's being\add* purified¦52905 must¦52904 then wash¦52904 their clothes¦52908, shave¦52909 all¦52912 their hair¦52914, and¦52915 then bathe in \add flowing\add* water¦52916. After¦52918 that, they can re-enter the¦52922 camp¦52922 \add ≈but¦52923\add* must¦52923 live outside¦52924 their tent¦52925 for seven¦52926 \add more\add* days¦52927.
