\v 56 and¦53799 \add #swellings¦53799\add*, rashes, and bright \add #spots¦53801\add* \add on the skin\add*,
\v 57 \add ≈so¦53806 that¦53808 you'll know how to¦53803 determine what's\add* ‘unclean¦53805’ or ‘clean¦53807’. Those are¦53809 the regulations for \add ≈infectious growths\add*.
