\v 4 Any bed¦53859 that¦53860 he¦53861 was lying¦53861 on¦53862 during \add or after\add* the¦53863 discharge¦53863 becomes ‘unclean¦53864’, as does anything he¦53870 sits¦53870 on¦53871.
