\v 22 Anyone¦54164 who¦54164 touches¦54164 anything that¦54168 she¦54170 sat¦54170 on¦54171 must¦54172 wash¦54172 their clothes¦54173 and¦54174 bathe in water¦54175, and¦54176 they'll be¦54176 ‘unclean¦54176’ until¦54177 the¦54179 evening¦54179,
