\v 24 If¦54204 a¦54207 man¦54207 \add ≈sleeps¦54206 with\add* \add @a¦54208 menstruating¦54208 woman¦54208\add* and¦54209 \add ≈gets blood\add* on¦54211 him¦54211, then¦54212 he'll¦54212 be¦54212 ‘unclean¦54212’ for seven¦54213 days¦54214, and¦54215 any bed¦54217 that¦54218 he¦54220 lies¦54220 on¦54221 will¦54222 \add also\add* become ‘unclean¦54222’.
