\v 26 Any bed¦54257 that¦54258 she¦54260 lies¦54260 on¦54261 \add ≈as long as she's discharging¦54265 blood will be regarded the¦54266 same as during her¦54267 menstruation¦54267 and¦54271 will¦54268\add* be¦54268 ‘unclean¦54277’, as will anything she sits¦54275 on¦54276.
