\v 30 and¦54329 he¦54329 will¦54329 offer¦54329 one¦54333 as a¦54334 sin¦54334 offering¦54334 and¦54335 \add ≈the¦54337 other\add* as a¦54338 burnt¦54338 offering¦54338, \add ≈thus making¦54339 her right with\add* Yahweh¦54343 from¦54344 her¦54345 ‘\add ≈unclean¦54345\add*’ flow.
