\v 29 This will¦54970 be a¦54972 permanent¦54973 regulation¦54972 for you all:
\p On the 10th of¦54972 the¦54975 seventh¦54975 month¦54977 \add (of Tishrei—around September/October)\add*, all of you¦54986 including¦54988 those who¦54989 are native-born¦54987 as well as foreigners¦54988 living¦54989 among¦54990 you¦54990, must humble¦54978 yourselves and¦54982 not \add ≈work¦54984 that day\add*\x + \xo 16:29-34: \xt Lev 23:26-32; Num 29:7-11.\x*
