\v 34 That¦55064 will¦55062 become¦55062 a¦55066 permanent¦55067 regulation¦55066 every year¦55077 to¦55068 \add ≈make¦55068 all¦55073 the¦55071 Israelis¦55072 right with Yahweh because of¦55075\add* their¦55075 sins¦55075.
