\v 10 \add If there's\add* any¦55277 \add ≈Israeli¦55269\add* or foreigner living¦55273 among¦55274 them¦55274, who¦55275 eats¦55276 blood¦55279, then¦55280 I'll¦55280 \add ≈oppose\add* that person¦55282 and¦55287 remove them from¦55289 \add ≈the¦55289 community\add*\x + \xo 17:10: \xt Gen 9:4; Lev 7:26-27; 19:26; Deu 12:16,23; 15:23.\x*
