\v 13 \add ≈So¦55337 any person\add* (\add ≈Israeli¦55340\add* or foreigner living¦55344 among¦55345 them¦55345) who¦55346 catches wild game¦55348 (\add ≈including\add* \add #birds¦55352\add*) to eat¦55354, they must¦55355 pour¦55355 its¦55358 blood¦55358 out¦55355 and¦55359 cover¦55359 it¦55359 with¦55360 soil
