\p
\v 1 Then¦56410 Yahweh¦56411 told¦56410 Mosheh¦56414:
\p
\v 2 Tell¦56422 the¦56419 \add ≈Israeli¦56420 people\add* that if any of¦56426 them, or any foreigner staying in¦56432 Yisrael¦56432, gives¦56434 any¦56435 of¦56435 their \add ≈children¦56435\add* to¦56436 Molek¦56436, then \add *that person\add* must¦56438 \add ≈definitely be¦56438 executed¦56438\add*—the¦56439 people¦56439 must¦56441 do it by throwing rocks¦56441 at them.
\v 3 \add Yes,\add* I myself will¦56445 \add ≈personally punish\add* that¦56450 person¦56449 and¦56451 cut¦56451 them off¦56451 from¦56453 the¦56453 people¦56454 for¦56455 giving¦56457 their \add ≈child¦56456\add* to¦56458 Molek¦56458 and so¦56459 making¦56460 my¦56463 sanctuary¦56463 ‘unclean¦56460’ and¦56464 profaning¦56464 my¦56468 \add ≈sacred¦56468\add* name¦56467.
