\v 5 then¦56489 I'll¦56489 \add also\add* remove that¦56495 \add other\add* person¦56494 and¦56496 their clan¦56496. I'll¦56497 cut¦56497 them off¦56497 from¦56508 their¦56509 people¦56509, along with anyone else who¦56503 practises prostitution¦56503 by¦56505 prostituting¦56505 themselves to Molek¦56507.
