\v 6 I'll \add ≈take action¦56520 against\add* any person¦56511 who¦56512 turns¦56513 to¦56514 mediums¦56516 or diviners¦56519 to¦56520 prostitute¦56520 themselves to them¦56521, and I'll cut¦56528 them off¦56528 from¦56530 their people¦56531.
\v 7 You¦56533 must¦56533 keep¦56533 yourselves¦56533 \add ≈separate from those kinds of things to be¦56534\add* holy¦56535, because¦56536 I¦56537, Yahweh¦56538, am¦56538 your¦56539 god¦56539.
\v 8 You¦56541 all must¦56541 \add ≈follow my¦56544 instructions¦56544\add* and¦56545 \add ≈implement\add* them¦56546. I¦56547 am¦56548 Yahweh¦56548 who¦56549 \add ≈makes you¦56549 different from other people groups\add*.
