\v 9 Any person who¦56555 curses¦56556 their father¦56559 or mother¦56562 must¦56564 be¦56564 \add ≈executed¦56564\add*—their blood¦56568 will be on¦56569 \add @their¦56569 own¦56569 head¦56569\add* for cursing their \add ≈parents\add*.\x + \xo 20:9: \xt Exo 21:17; Mat 15:4; Mrk 7:10.\x*
