\v 10 Any man¦56571 who¦56572 commits¦56573 adultery¦56573 with another man's¦56577 wife¦56582, maybe even his¦56583 neighbours¦56583 wife, must¦56586 be¦56586 \add ≈executed¦56586\add*—both the¦56587 \add ≈man and¦56588 the¦56588 woman\add*.\x + \xo 20:10: \xt Exo 20:14; Lev 18:20; Deu 5:18.\x*
\v 11 Any man¦56590 who¦56591 sleeps¦56592 with¦56593 any of¦56595 his¦56596 father's¦56596 \add #wives¦56595\add*, has¦56599 exposed¦56599 his¦56598 father's¦56598 nakedness¦56597. Both¦56603 of¦56603 them¦56603 must¦56602 be¦56602 \add ≈executed¦56602\add*—their¦56604 blood¦56604 is¦56605 on¦56605 \add @their¦56605 own¦56605 heads¦56605\add*.\x + \xo 20:11: \xt Lev 18:8; Deu 22:30; 27:20.\x*
\v 12 If a¦56607 man¦56607 sleeps¦56609 with¦56610 his¦56612 daughter-in-law¦56612, both¦56615 of¦56615 them¦56615 must¦56614 be¦56614 executed¦56614. That's perversion and so their¦56618 blood¦56618 is¦56619 on¦56619 \add @their¦56619 own¦56619 heads¦56619\add*.\x + \xo 20:12: \xt Lev 18:15.\x*
\v 13 If a¦56621 man¦56621 \add ≈has a sexual relationship\add* with¦56624 another man, both of¦56627 them have¦56630 done¦56630 something \add ≈detestable¦56629\add* and both¦56631 of¦56631 them¦56631 must¦56633 be¦56633 executed¦56633—their¦56634 blood¦56634 is¦56635 on¦56635 \add @their¦56635 own¦56635 heads¦56635\add*.\x + \xo 20:13: \xt Lev 18:22.\x*
\v 14 If a¦56637 man¦56637 takes¦56639 both a¦56642 mother¦56645 and her¦56645 daughter as wives, then that's \add ≈wicked¦56646\add*. They must¦56649 all be burnt¦56649 \add ≈to death\add* so that depravity won't¦56652 \add take root\add* among¦56656 you¦56656.
