\v 15 If a¦56658 man¦56658 \add tries to\add* \add ≈have sex with\add* an¦56662 animal¦56662, that man must¦56664 be¦56664 executed¦56664 and¦56665 the¦56667 animal¦56667 must¦56668 \add also\add* be killed¦56668.\x + \xo 20:15-16: \xt Exo 22:19; Lev 18:23; Deu 27:21.\x*
