\v 17 If a¦56692 man¦56692 \add ?≈sleeps with\add* his sister (whether on his¦56701 father's¦56701 or¦56702 mother's¦56705 side) and they see each other's nakedness, it's¦56717 a¦56716 disgrace¦56716 and¦56718 they¦56718 must¦56718 be¦56718 cut¦56718 off¦56718 from their¦56721 people¦56721—he's¦56724 exposed¦56724 her¦56709 nakedness and he¦56726 must¦56726 bear¦56726 his wickedness¦56725.\x + \xo 20:17: \xt Lev 18:9; Deu 27:22.\x*
