\p
\v 22 You¦56799 all¦56802 must \add ≈obey my¦56804 instructions¦56804 and¦56805 decisions¦56809\add* and¦56810 \add ≈stick to\add* them¦56811, and then¦56812 the¦56816 land¦56816 that I'm¦56818 about¦56819 to¦56819 take¦56819 you¦56820 into, won't¦56812 vomit¦56814 you¦56815 all out.
