\v 24 and¦56844 I've¦56844 told¦56844 you all that you yourselves \add ≈will¦56847 inherit¦56847\add* their¦56850 land—I'll¦56852 give¦56852 it¦56852 to¦56853 you¦56853 \add ≈to¦56854 take¦56854 possession¦56854 of¦56854\add*. It's¦56855 a¦56856 land¦56856 flowing¦56857 with milk¦56858 and¦56859 honey¦56859. I¦56860 am¦56861 your¦56862 god¦56862 Yahweh¦56861 who¦56863 separates¦56865 you¦56866 all from¦56867 the¦56869 \add other\add* people¦56869 \add groups\add*.
\v 25 You¦56871 all must¦56871 \add ≈distinguish¦56871\add* between¦56872 ‘clean¦56875’ and¦56876 ‘unclean¦56876’ animals and¦56877 birds¦56879. Don't¦56882 make¦56884 yourselves detestable¦56884 \add to me\add* with any animal¦56888 or bird¦56889 or crawling¦56892 creature which¦56894 I've¦56896 distinguished for¦56897 you¦56897 all as ‘unclean¦56898’.
\v 26 You¦56900 all must¦56900 be¦56900 ‘holy’ to¦56901 me¦56901, because¦56903 I¦56905 Yahweh¦56906 am¦56904 holy¦56904, and¦56907 I've¦56907 set you¦56908 all apart¦56907 from¦56909 the¦56911 other \add ≈people¦56911 groups\add* to¦56912 be¦56912 mine.
\p
\v 27 Any man¦56915 or¦56916 woman¦56918 who's a¦56923 medium¦56923 or¦56924 diviner must¦56927 be¦56927 executed¦56927—the people¦56929 must¦56929 do it by throwing rocks¦56929 at them.
\c 21
