\p
\v 1 Then¦56935 Yahweh¦56936 told¦56935 Mosheh¦56939:
\p Tell¦56940 Aharon's¦56945 descendants¦56944 the¦56943 priests¦56943 that they must¦56946 not¦56949 defile¦56951 themselves among¦56952 the \add ≈Israelis\add*, by touching anything that's not living¦56948
\v 2 apart from the¦56958 body of a close¦56958 relative¦56957 like a \add ≈parent, child¦56962,\add* brother¦56964
\v 3 or \add ≈unmarried\add* sister¦56966—the priest can become ‘unclean¦56976’ by means of one of them.
