\v 5 They¦56986 must¦56986 not¦56992 shave¦56993 their¦56989 \add #heads¦56989\add* or trim the¦56990 edges of¦56990 their¦56991 \add #beards¦56991\add* or cut¦56996 their bodies \add in grief\add*.\x + \xo 21:5: \xt Lev 19:27-28; Deu 14:1.\x*
