\v 9 If¦57056 a¦57055 priest's¦57055 daughter¦57053 prostituted¦57058 herself¦57057, she¦57062 would be¦57063 profaning¦57063 her¦57061 father¦57061 \add so\add* must¦57065 be¦57065 burnt¦57065 \add to death\add*.
