\v 10 The¦57068 priest¦57068 who is chief of¦57070 all his¦57070 brothers¦57070 and who¦57071 had the¦57079 anointing¦57079 oil¦57078 poured¦57073 over his¦57076 head¦57076, and¦57080 \add ≈who has¦57080 the responsibility of\add* wearing¦57084 the¦57087 \add special\add* clothing¦57087, must not \add ≈wear his hair loose¦57092\add*, and¦57093 he¦57095 must¦57095 not tear¦57095 his clothes \add in grief\add*.
