\v 14 he mustn't take a¦57133 widow¦57133 or a¦57134 divorced¦57134 woman¦57148, or a¦57135 defiled¦57135 prostitute¦57136. He can only \add ≈marry\add* an unmarried, \add ≈Israeli\add* girl,
\v 15 then¦57150 he¦57152 won't¦57150 profane¦57152 his¦57153 offspring among¦57154 his¦57154 relatives, because¦57155 I¦57156 am¦57157 Yahweh¦57157 who¦57158 sets¦57158 him¦57158 apart¦57158 as¦57158 ‘holy¦57158’.
\p
\v 16 Then¦57161 Yahweh¦57162 told¦57161 Mosheh¦57165,
\p
\v 17 Tell¦57168 Aharon¦57171 that \add ≈none of¦57174 his descendants¦57175\add* who¦57176 have a¦57179 \add ≈deformity\add* should ever approach¦57181 to¦57182 present¦57182 the¦57183 food¦57183 for his¦57184 god¦57184.
\v 18 \add ≈Yes,\add* no man¦57189 who¦57190 has a¦57193 \add ≈deformity\add* must¦57195 approach¦57195 \add to offer a sacrifice\add*, i.e., no one¦57196 who's blind¦57197, lame¦57199, mutilated, or¦57200 \add ≈with a¦57201 swelling\add*,
\v 19 or¦57205 with a broken foot¦57212 or¦57213 hand¦57215,
\v 20 or¦57217 a¦57219 hunchback¦57219 or¦57220 dwarf, or¦57223 with an eye¦57225 defect¦57224, with a scab¦57229 or rash¦57227, or anyone with a¦57231 crushed¦57231 testicle¦57232.
\v 21 Any¦57234 \add ≈descendant of\add* Aharon¦57242 the¦57243 priest¦57243 with a blemish mustn't approach¦57245 to preset a gift to Yahweh¦57250—no that person¦57236 mustn't approach¦57257 to¦57258 present¦57258 god's¦57255 food¦57254.
\v 22 However, they can eat¦57267 those gifts for God¦57261, including the sacred and¦57264 very sacred¦57266 \add ≈portions\add*.
\v 23 \add ≈Despite that,\add* they mustn't enter past the¦57272 curtain¦57272 or approach¦57275 the¦57277 altar¦57277 if¦57280 they have a¦57282 defect¦57282 on¦57283 \add ≈their body\add*. They mustn't profane¦57285 my¦57288 sanctuary¦57288 because¦57289 I¦57290 am¦57291 Yahweh¦57291 who¦57292 sets¦57292 them¦57292 apart¦57292 as¦57292 ‘holy¦57292’.
\p
\v 24 \add ≈So¦57294\add* Mosheh¦57295 told¦57294 \add all\add* that to¦57296 Aharon¦57298 and¦57299 his¦57301 sons¦57301, and¦57302 all¦57304 the¦57306 \add ≈Israelis¦57307\add*.
\c 22
