\v 16 or else they'll¦57584 cause¦57584 themselves to¦57584 bear¦57584 the guilt¦57587 from their¦57591 disobedience concerning eating¦57588 sacred¦57591 \add >food\add*, because¦57592 I¦57593 am¦57594 Yahweh¦57594 who¦57595 has separated¦57595 them¦57595 to be sacred¦57595.
