\v 19 to \add ≈be accepted¦57642\add* it must¦57643 be¦57643 a¦57644 male¦57644 with \add ≈no¦57643 defects¦57643\add*, whether it's a cow, or a sheep¦57646, or a \add #goat¦57647\add*.
\v 20 Anything that¦57650 has a¦57653 defect¦57653 must \em not¦57654\em* be presented¦57655 because¦57656 it¦57660 \add ≈wouldn't be¦57660 acceptable¦57659\add* on your¦57661 behalf.\x + \xo 22:20: \xt Deu 17:1.\x*
