\p
\v 1 Then¦57860 Yahweh¦57861 told¦57860 Mosheh¦57864:
\p
\v 2 Tell the \add Israelis\add* that¦57876 they must¦57878 proclaim¦57878 Yahweh's¦57875 scheduled festivals as \add ≈sacred¦57881\add* assemblies¦57880 \add ≈at the given times\add*.
\s2 The rest day
