\p
\v 3 Work for six¦57886 days¦57887, then¦57890 the¦57891 seventh¦57891 is a¦57892 rest day \add for\add* a¦57894 \add ≈sacred¦57896\add* assembly¦57894—don't¦57900 work¦57899 on that day—\add ≈wherever you¦57901 live¦57906\add* it's a rest day \add ≈to¦57904 honour\add* Yahweh¦57904.\x + \xo 23:3: \xt Exo 20:8-10; 23:12; 31:15; 34:21; 35:2; Deu 5:12-14.\x*
\rem /s1 The Passover and Unleavened Bread
