\v 4 \add ≈The following\add* are¦57910 the¦57910 scheduled festivals¦57910 that¦57914 you¦57916 must¦57916 proclaim¦57916 at¦57918 the appointed¦57918 \add #times¦57918\add* as \add ≈sacred¦57913\add* assemblies¦57912:
