\v 46 and¦59615 then pass them¦59617 on to¦59618 your¦59618 children¦59618 to¦59620 own¦59621 as their inheritance¦59615. You¦59619 all can make them¦59623 work¦59624 indefinitely \add for you\add*, but¦59625 you¦59633 mustn't \add ≈harshly¦59635\add* oppress your¦59625 \add ≈fellow Israelis¦59628\add*.
